      "id": "sol.amc-8-2003-p5.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Since \\(20\\%\\) of the number is \\(12,\\) \\(10\\%\\) of the number is \\(6.\\)\n\nTherefore \\(30\\%\\) of the same number is \\(3\\cdot6=18.\\)\n\nThus, B is the correct answer.",
